"For subsets of the form §7, you can simplify the statement\n"
"§8 with §9 to §10."
msgstr ""
"For a subset §0 and an element §1 of §2 (more precisely: of type §3), §4 means that §5 is contained in §6.\n"
"\n"
"For a subset of the form §7, you can use §9 to simplify §8 to §10."

