#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:187
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 means that §2 is contained in §3.\n"
"\n"
"With §4, you can rewrite §5 as §6.\n"
"\n"
"If §7 is the proof goal, you can also directly use §8\n"
"to select an element §9 with §10 (and then show §11).\n"
"\n"
"If §12 is an assumption and an element §13 with §14 is given,\n"
"you can use §15 to obtain the statement §16.\n"
"\n"
"You write §17 as §18."
msgstr ""
"For §0, the notation §1 means that §2 is contained in §3.\n"
"\n"
"With §4, you can rewrite §5 as §6. \n"
"\n"
"## §1 as proof goal\n"
"\n"
"If §1 is your goal, you can pick an element §9 with §10 using §8 (and then show §11). \n"
"\n"
"## §1 as assumption\n"
"\n"
"Given the assumption §12 and an element §13 with §14 is given, you obtain the statement §16 with §15. \n"
"\n"
"You write §17 as §18."

