"§0 is the empty subset.\n"
"In the Formaloverse §1 is something different than §2\n"
"– one is a subset of ℕ, the other is a subset of ℝ!\n"
"\n"
"With §3 you translate the equation §4 into the\n"
"statement §5.\n"
"\n"
"§6 is written as §7."
msgstr ""
"§0 is the empty subset. In Leanish, §1 is therefore different from §2 – one is a subset of ℕ, the other a subset of ℝ! \n"
"\n"
"With §3, you convert an equality of the form §4 into the statement §5. \n"
"\n"
"You write §6 as §7."

