msgid ""
"§0 is the “subset” consisting of *all* elements of type §1.\n"
"\n"
"With §2, you convert an equation of the form §3 into the\n"
"statement §4."
msgstr "§0 is the “sub”set consisting of *all* elements of type §1. With §2, you convert an equation of the form §3 into the statement §4."

