"For a finite subset §0 and an element §1,\n"
"§2 is another way of writing §3.\n"
"If §4 is not in §5 at all, then obviously §6."
msgstr "For a finite subset §0 and an element §1, §2 is alternative notation for §3. If §4 is not in §5 to begin with, then it is obviously §6."

#. §0: `A : Finset T`
#. §1: `card A : ℕ`
