#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `𝓝`
#. §3: `\\nhds`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:274
msgid ""
"§0 is the neighborhood filter: it consists of all neighborhoods of §1.\n"
"(A set is a neighboorhood of a point a it it contains an open set containing a.)\n"
"\n"
"To type the symbol §2, write §3."
