#. §9: `h : A ∧ B`
#. §10: `h₁ : A`
#. §11: `h₂ : B`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:354
msgid ""
"§0 (“and”) is the statement that both §1 and §2 are true.\n"
"\n"
"## §3 as a proof goal\n"
"\n"
"The tactic §4 allows you to prove the two sub-statements §5 and §6 individually.\n"
"\n"
"## §7 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"With §8, you break down an assumption of the form §9\n"
"into its components §10 and §11."
msgstr ""
"§0 (“A and B”) is the statement that both §1 and §2 are true. \n"
"\n"
"## §3 as goal\n"
"\n"
"The tactic §4 allows you to prove the two sub-statements §5 and §6 individually. \n"
"\n"
