#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:487
msgid ""
"If you have given an equation §0 or an equivalence §1 as an assumption or lemma,\n"
"you can use §2 to replace all occurrences of §3 in the proof target with §4.\n"
"\n"
"## Variants\n"
"\n"
"* §5 applies §6 backwards, i.e., replaces all §7 with §8.\n"
"* §9 applies §10, §11, and (backwards) §12.\n"
"* §13 performs the replacements in the assumption §14, not in the proof target\n"
"* §15: If §16 has arguments, e.g., §17 in\n"
"§18\n"
"   or in\n"
"§19\n"
"   §20 searches the proof target from left to right for a matching expression,\n"
"   and then replaces *all* occurrences of *the first* expression that the tactic finds.\n"
"   With §21, you can replace all occurrences of the §22th expression instead.\n"
"\n"
"  | before    | tactic       | after        |\n"
"  |:----------------- |:------------- - |:----------------- |\n"
"  | §23 | §24       | §25 |\n"
"  |                   | §26 | §27 |"
msgstr ""
"Given an equation §0 or an equivalence §1 as an assumption or lemma, §2 replaces all occurrences of §3 in the goal with §4. \n"
"\n"
"## Variants \n"
"\n"
"* §5 applies §6 backwards, i.e. replaces all §7 with §8. \n"
"* §9 applies §10, §11 and (backwards) §12.\n"
"* §13 performs the replacements in the assumption §14, not in the goal. \n"
"* §15: If §16 has arguments, e.g. §17 in \n"
"§18 \n"
"  or in \n"
"§19, \n"
"  §20 searches the goal from left to right for a matching expression and then replaces *all* occurrences *of the first* expression that it finds.\n"
"With §21, you can replace all occurrences of the §22nd expression that is found instead. \n"
"\n"
"| before | Tactic | after | \n"
"|:----------------- |:-------------- |:----------------- |\n"
"| §23 | §24 | §25 | \n"
"|    | §26 | §27 | "

