"§0 is equivalent to §1: \n"
"the tactic replaces the assumption §2 with the special case §3. \n"
"\n"
"If you want to specialise multiple times, you should use §5 instead of §4, as §6 overwrites the old assumption §7. For example, you could apply \n"
