"\n"
"## Variants \n"
"* §3 operates on the assumption §4 instead of the goal \n"
"* §5 is the result of §6 and can be used like §7 \n"
"\n"
"So each of the following three tactics or tactic sequences has the same effect: \n"
"* §8 \n"
"* §9 \n"
"* §10"

