"With §0, you insert an intermediate step into an equation or equivalence. \n"
"\n"
"| before | tactic | after | \n"
"|:------------ |:--------- |:-----------------------| \n"
"| §1 | §2 | §3 and §4 | \n"
"| §5 | §6 | §7 and §8 | \n"
"\n"
"By repeating this tactic several times, you can perform a step-by-step “calculation” §9. \n"
"\n"
"(Outside of this game, however, the multi-line tactic §10 is better suited for such calculations.)"

