"\n"
"**You**: Sure, let's have a look at it! Scribble, could you perhaps show me another nice summary of what I've learned in the last five minutes? \n"
"\n"
"**Scribble**: Here it is: \n"
"\n"
"## Notation\n"
"\n"
"| | Description |\n"
"|:--- |:---------------------------- | \n"
"| §0 | Implication | \n"
"| §1 | exactly-when / equivalence | \n"
"\n"
"## Tactics \n"
"\n"
"| Tactic | Example | \n"
"|:---------------- |:----------------------------------------------------------------- | \n"
