"A shy “Head of Operations” is waiting for you.\n"
"\n"
"**Head of Operations**: You've come at just the right moment! I've already heard about you. Real mathematicians! You see, we extract truth values here. And you have to be extremely careful. One mistake and everything collapses. I'm very cautious. I always say: downtime over downfall!"

