"\n"
"**You**: What kind of library would you have liked to direct? \n"
"\n"
"**Euclid**: I was promised that I would find, “among other things”, translations into Leanish of the writings of my famous ancestor. You know, the one from *your* universe. And now I've been searching for years, in the catalogue and on the actual shelves, and I've still only found tiny fragments. Look, I've finally started to formulate one of his results myself. Perhaps you could help me?"

