#: Game/Levels/Epo.lean:40
msgid "Intro Epo"
msgstr ""
"The planet you are now approaching has two buildings: a narrow skyscraper and a second, wider building with slightly fewer floors. The buildings are connected by a strange system of tubes. At the top of the skyscraper, you can see a landing pad. You head for it.\n"
"\n"
"As you disembark, a formalosopher comes running towards you. He waves his arms wildly. \n"
"\n"
"**Porter**: No, no, you're expected down there. He lowers his arms.\n"
"\n"
"**Porter**: Well, never mind. Good afternoon, first of all! I'm just one of the porters. You are expected by a large delegation, but over there, in the office building, of course. These here are just our sleeping quarters. Come on, I'll take you over. It won't take long.\n"
"\n"
"He leads you down one floor and asks Scribble and you to get into two single-seat “transport capsules”.\n"
"\n"
"**Porter**: We'll just slide over in these capsules. Hope you enjoy it.  We do have some collisions from time to time, but right now the coast is clear. Everyone else is already over on the other side, waiting for you!"

