#: Game/Levels/Mono.lean:51
msgid "Intro Mono"
msgstr ""
"On the next planet, there are again two skyscrapers standing next to each other. Again, one is narrow and tall, the other slightly wider and shorter. And once again, they are connected by a system of tubes – there appears to be some kind of transport capsule system again. \n"
"\n"
"After your experience on Epo, you head straight for the shorter skyscraper this time and land on the roof. \n"
"\n"
"**Porter**:  No, no, no. Didn't you see everyone waving? These are just our sleeping quarters. During the day, we're always over there, in the office tower. Anyway, now that you're here – welcome! \n"
"\n"
"You each shake one of his four hands. \n"
"\n"
"**Porter**: At least this gives me the opportunity to introduce you to our unique local transport system. You’ve just arrived from Epo, haven’t you? We hear terrible stories from there. There's an accident every other day. They just can't get their tubes sorted out. We've been accident-free for years! \n"
"\n"
"You go down four floors. There, everyone is assigned a capsule again, and you glide silently uphill into the office tower. How the capsule operates remains a mystery.\n"
"\n"
"**Scribble**: Oh. There's no one here either! \n"
"\n"
"**Porter**: Of course not. They're all upstairs, top floor. And not every floor can be reached via a tube. But we're almost there. Just two more flights of stairs."

