#: Game/Levels/Samarkand.lean:48
msgid "Intro Samarkand"
msgstr ""
"A very colourful planet appears in the distance. As you get closer, you see that large parts of its surface are decorated with elaborate geometric patterns. But there are also a few undecorated areas, completely white. You land in one of these white spots. \n"
"\n"
"**You**: Hello, is anyone here? \n"
"\n"
"The planet's surface resembles a perfect sphere. There's a smooth horizon in every direction. But there's no one to be seen. You are about to turn back when you notice something. \n"
"\n"
"**You**: Scribble, look over there, the planet has a bump! \n"
"\n"
"It turns out that the “bump” is a small turtle lying on the decorated part of the planet, but close to the edge of the white area. You carefully step onto the patterned surface. The paint seems to be dry. \n"
"\n"
"**Arapuka**: Hello, you two, do come closer! It's nice to have visitors for once. \n"
"\n"
"**You**: What are you doing here all alone?\n"
"\n"
"**Arapuka**: I'm investing myself in a big work of art. I'll lie here until my shell has taken on the pattern of the ground. Then I'll walk over to the spot where this piece of pattern is still missing and lie down there until I've transferred the pattern to the white surface of the planet. It takes a while, so I could use some company. \n"
"\n"
"**You**: Great."

